      <activity id="18dd8d6d-6b9c-5f57-9385-e7c9a482ecce" activityNameId="41c1395e-9cda-5c29-965f-f34dca452e58" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer system, PP-HM pipe, SN 8, DN 600, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer system, PP-HM pipe, SN 8, DN 600, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 899c6b37-28b2-4f73-8f57-f0ff8a422629
This process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with PP-HM pipe, DN 600, SN 8, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with PP-HM pipe.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Complete sewer system, DN 600, SN 8, profile 4 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. PP-HM pipe, ID 586 mm, outer diameter 630 mm, wall thickness 21 mm, 38 kg/m, 930 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_899c6b37-28b2-4f73-8f57-f0ff8a422629.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
